WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.285
What the Sun will become.

00:02.060 --> 00:04.018
The orange star is Arcturus.

00:04.368 --> 00:09.639
It weighs about the same as the Sun, but it is older, and the hydrogen in its core has run out.

00:10.224 --> 00:12.988
So it has swollen to twenty-five times the Sun's width.

00:13.630 --> 00:17.940
In about five billion years, the Sun will become a red giant too.
